WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
A model judge is another
component that needs evaluation.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.160
Compare its decisions
with independently reviewed labels

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:09.200
and inspect false acceptance
of incorrect outputs.

00:00:09.337 --> 00:00:12.880
Repeat ambiguous cases and test
sensitivity to answer order.

00:00:13.024 --> 00:00:17.040
Keep calibration examples
separate from final evaluation.

00:00:17.093 --> 00:00:21.440
Recheck the judge when its prompt,
model or task population changes.

00:00:21.476 --> 00:00:24.160
Critical disagreements may
require a deterministic check

00:00:24.213 --> 00:00:27.440
or expert gate instead
of a larger average score.
